      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview-of-our-research&#34;&gt;Overview of Our Research&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our research focuses on &lt;strong&gt;Data+AI&lt;/strong&gt;, bridging the gap between data management and artificial intelligence. We explore two main directions: &lt;strong&gt;DB4AI&lt;/strong&gt; (Database for AI) and &lt;strong&gt;AI4DB&lt;/strong&gt; (AI for Database).&lt;/p&gt;
